# Étape 3 — Structure SQL

## Table véhicules

```sql id="d1i3yh"
CREATE TABLE vehicles (
    id SERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
    plaque VARCHAR(50),
    chauffeur VARCHAR(100),
    capacite INT,
    statut VARCHAR(50)
);
```

---

## Table livraisons

```sql id="ogv0va"
CREATE TABLE deliveries (
    id SERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
    vehicle_id INT,
    destination VARCHAR(255),
    depart_time TIMESTAMP,
    arrival_time TIMESTAMP,
    statut VARCHAR(50),
    cout FLOAT,
    retard BOOLEAN
);
```

---

## Table météo

```sql id="1hmpc0"
CREATE TABLE weather_data (
    id SERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
    ville VARCHAR(100),
    temperature FLOAT,
    pluie FLOAT,
    humidite FLOAT,
    date_releve TIMESTAMP
);
```

---

## Table GPS temps réel

```sql id="gcqk2g"
CREATE TABLE gps_tracking (
    id SERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
    vehicle_id INT,
    latitude FLOAT,
    longitude FLOAT,
    vitesse FLOAT,
    date_position TIMESTAMP
);
```

